{"page":153,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:23","surah":7,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَا رَبَّنَا ظَلَمْنَآ أَنفُسَنَا وَإِن لَّمْ تَغْفِرْ لَنَا وَتَرْحَمْنَا لَنَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلْخَـٰسِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They replied, ‘Our Lord, we have wronged our souls: if You do not forgive us and have mercy, we shall be lost.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَا","en_gloss":"Both of them said","transliteration":"qālā","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ظَلَمْنَآ","en_gloss":"we have wronged","transliteration":"ẓalamnā","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنفُسَنَا","en_gloss":"ourselves","transliteration":"anfusanā","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"You forgive","transliteration":"taghfir","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَنَا","en_gloss":"[for] us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَتَرْحَمْنَا","en_gloss":"and have mercy (on) us","transliteration":"watarḥamnā","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَنَكُونَنَّ","en_gloss":"surely, we will be","transliteration":"lanakūnanna","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْخَـٰسِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the losers","transliteration":"l-khāsirīna","verse_key":"7:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:23"}]},{"verse_key":"7:24","surah":7,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ ٱهْبِطُوا۟ بَعْضُكُمْ لِبَعْضٍ عَدُوٌّ ۖ وَلَكُمْ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ مُسْتَقَرٌّ وَمَتَـٰعٌ إِلَىٰ حِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He said, ‘All of you get out! You are each other’s enemies. On earth you will have a place to stay and livelihood- for a time.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"(Allah) said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱهْبِطُوا۟","en_gloss":"Get down","transliteration":"ih'biṭū","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَعْضُكُمْ","en_gloss":"some of you","transliteration":"baʿḍukum","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِبَعْضٍ","en_gloss":"to some others","transliteration":"libaʿḍin","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَدُوٌّۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(as) enemy","transliteration":"ʿaduwwun","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"And for you","transliteration":"walakum","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُسْتَقَرٌّۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a dwelling place","transliteration":"mus'taqarrun","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَتَـٰعٌ","en_gloss":"and livelihood","transliteration":"wamatāʿun","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"حِينٍۢ","en_gloss":"a time","transliteration":"ḥīnin","verse_key":"7:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:24"}]},{"verse_key":"7:25","surah":7,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ فِيهَا تَحْيَوْنَ وَفِيهَا تَمُوتُونَ وَمِنْهَا تُخْرَجُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He said, ‘There you will live; there you will die; from there you will be brought out.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"7:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"In it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"7:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَحْيَوْنَ","en_gloss":"you will live","transliteration":"taḥyawna","verse_key":"7:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَفِيهَا","en_gloss":"and in it","transliteration":"wafīhā","verse_key":"7:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَمُوتُونَ","en_gloss":"you will die","transliteration":"tamūtūna","verse_key":"7:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمِنْهَا","en_gloss":"and from it","transliteration":"wamin'hā","verse_key":"7:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُخْرَجُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be brought forth","transliteration":"tukh'rajūna","verse_key":"7:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:25"}]},{"verse_key":"7:26","surah":7,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ ءَادَمَ قَدْ أَنزَلْنَا عَلَيْكُمْ لِبَاسًا يُوَٰرِى سَوْءَٰتِكُمْ وَرِيشًا ۖ وَلِبَاسُ ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ ذَٰلِكَ خَيْرٌ ۚ ذَٰلِكَ مِنْ ءَايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَذَّكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Children of Adam, We have given you garments to cover your nakedness and as adornment for you; the garment of God-consciousness is the best of all garments- this is one of God’s signs, so that people may take heed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"O Children","transliteration":"yābanī","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَادَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Adam","transliteration":"ādama","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We have sent down","transliteration":"anzalnā","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِبَاسًۭا","en_gloss":"clothing","transliteration":"libāsan","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُوَٰرِى","en_gloss":"it covers","transliteration":"yuwārī","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَوْءَٰتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your shame","transliteration":"sawātikum","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَرِيشًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"and (as) an adornment","transliteration":"warīshan","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلِبَاسُ","en_gloss":"But the clothing","transliteration":"walibāsu","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","en_gloss":"(of) [the] righteousness ","transliteration":"l-taqwā","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) best","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"(is) from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) Signs","transliteration":"āyāti","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَذَّكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"remember","transliteration":"yadhakkarūna","verse_key":"7:26"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:26"}]},{"verse_key":"7:27","surah":7,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ ءَادَمَ لَا يَفْتِنَنَّكُمُ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ كَمَآ أَخْرَجَ أَبَوَيْكُم مِّنَ ٱلْجَنَّةِ يَنزِعُ عَنْهُمَا لِبَاسَهُمَا لِيُرِيَهُمَا سَوْءَٰتِهِمَآ ۗ إِنَّهُۥ يَرَىٰكُمْ هُوَ وَقَبِيلُهُۥ مِنْ حَيْثُ لَا تَرَوْنَهُمْ ۗ إِنَّا جَعَلْنَا ٱلشَّيَـٰطِينَ أَوْلِيَآءَ لِلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Children of Adam, do not let Satan seduce you, as he did your parents, causing them to leave the Garden, stripping them of their garments to expose their nakedness to them: he and his forces can see you from where you cannot see them: We have made evil ones allies to those who do not believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"O Children","transliteration":"yābanī","verse_key":"7:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَادَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Adam","transliteration":"ādama","verse_key":"7:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Let) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَفْتِنَنَّكُمُ","en_gloss":"tempt you","transliteration":"yaftinannakumu","verse_key":"7:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"[the] Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"7:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَمَآ","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"7:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَخْرَجَ","en_gloss":"he drove out","transliteration":"akh