},{"pos":28,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"of those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"7:27"},{"pos":29,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:27"},{"pos":30,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"7:27"},{"pos":31,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:27"}]},{"verse_key":"7:28","surah":7,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا فَعَلُوا۟ فَـٰحِشَةً قَالُوا۟ وَجَدْنَا عَلَيْهَآ ءَابَآءَنَا وَٱللَّهُ أَمَرَنَا بِهَا ۗ قُلْ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَأْمُرُ بِٱلْفَحْشَآءِ ۖ أَتَقُولُونَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ مَا لَا تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yet when [these people] do something disgraceful, they say, ‘We found our forefathers doing this,’ and, ‘God has commanded us to do this.’ Say [Prophet], ‘God does not command disgraceful deeds. How can you say about God things that you do not know [to be true]?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فَعَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they do","transliteration":"faʿalū","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَـٰحِشَةًۭ","en_gloss":"immorality","transliteration":"fāḥishatan","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَجَدْنَا","en_gloss":"We found","transliteration":"wajadnā","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَيْهَآ","en_gloss":"on it","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَابَآءَنَا","en_gloss":"our forefathers","transliteration":"ābāanā","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَمَرَنَا","en_gloss":"(has) ordered us","transliteration":"amaranā","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِهَا ۗ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"7:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِن